                <pb facs="0827" n="739" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg739"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.5151/123: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >White</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-06-08T12:00:00-04:00">June 8, 1933—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received
                        1:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>53. Your June 3, 3 p.m.; my 51, June 7, 6 p.m. Reliably informed that it is the
                    Argentine Government’s intention to rescind objectionable circular.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
